      "value": "If this hypothesis were correct, the system would produce structured, justified outputs linking data (e.g., N_c(w) behavior for small w) to conclusions. Instead, the raw number dump implies a complete breakdown in reasoning—possibly due to hallucination, misrouting, or catastrophic forgetting of context. The opposite would be a coherent, traceable argument referencing w ≤ 10, N_c(w) constancy, and Surprise metrics."
